-- forward recovery (plan, section 9).
--
-- Atomic: ONE transaction for both parts (storage first, then core). A
-- deferred commit gate makes COMMIT fail unless the preflight and the
-- postcondition both completed, so any failure (also in a runner that
-- continues after errors) commits nothing.
--
-- Preserved, NOT restored (by design; see the plan, section 9):
